{"_id":"68a7361a8ec3d8323af16e27","nodeId":"U5mD5FmVx7VWeKxDpQxB5","roadmapSlug":"frontend","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:06.147Z","description":"# Authentication Strategies\n\nAuthentication strategies verify a user's identity to grant access. Common methods include Basic Auth (username/password), Session-based (server remembers login), Token-based (like JWT, a secure digital key), OAuth (for third-party access like \"Login with Google\"), and SSO (Single Sign-On, one login for many apps). Knowing these helps choose the right security for your app.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Basic Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/basic-authentication","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860a9f"},{"type":"article","title":"Session Based Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/session-based-authentication-visually-explained","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860aa0"},{"type":"article","title":"Token Based Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/token-authentication","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860aa1"},{"type":"article","title":"JWT Authentication","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/jwt-authentication","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860aa2"},{"type":"article","title":"OAuth","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/oauth","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860aa3"},{"type":"article","title":"SSO - Single Sign On","url":"https://roadmap.sh/guides/sso","_id":"6a686a7033d15c8310860aa4"}],"updatedAt":"2026-07-28T08:38:08.225Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/frontend/content/U5mD5FmVx7VWeKxDpQxB5.md"}